    {
      "line_id": "l0003",
      "text": "since ICJ is the principal organ of the UN, there is a limitation on Article IX. The claim is:",
      "bbox": [
        117.35999999999999,
        50.25599999999999,
        543.312,
        60.767999999999994
      ]
    },
    {
      "line_id": "l0004",
      "text": "(A) Maintainable, as the reservation explicitly prohibits the intervention of UN organs.",
      "bbox": [
        116.064,
        67.67999999999999,
        529.3439999999999,
        78.192
      ]
    },
    {
      "line_id": "l0005",
      "text": "(B) Not maintainable, as Article VIII concerns the discretionary function which is different",
      "bbox": [
        116.064,
        85.24799999999999,
        551.808,
        95.616
      ]
    },
